Package: gamayun-nas-apps
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Serzhdrako13 <serzhdrako13@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Serzhdrako13/gamayun-nas
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: gamayun-nas (= @VERSION@), iptables, nftables, kmod, avahi-daemon
Conflicts: docker-ce, docker.io, containerd, containerd.io, runc
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Description: GamayunNas — Docker applications (pinned versions)
 Docker @DOCKER@, containerd, runc, tini, docker-proxy, Compose @COMPOSE@ and
 Caddy @CADDY@ (application reverse proxy), unmodified upstream static builds.
 The services are started by gamayund after the applications pool is mounted;
 application data stays on the pool when the package is removed.
